{"id":"stattdessen","lemma":"stattdessen","pos":"adv","rank":1830,"glosses":["instead, in lieu (of)"],"ipa":"/ʃtatˈdɛsn̩/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/99/De-stattdessen.ogg/De-stattdessen.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Du kannst stattdessen am Montag kommen.","en":"You can come on Monday instead.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},null,{"g":"at the / on the"},{"g":"Monday"},{"g":"to come"}]},{"text":"Lass uns stattdessen Karten spielen.","en":"Let's play cards instead.","words":[{"g":"to allow","l":"lassen"},{"g":"us","l":"wir"},null,{"g":"card game"},{"g":"to play"}]},{"text":"Könnten wir nicht stattdessen kuscheln?","en":"Couldn't we cuddle, instead?","words":[{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"we"},{"g":"not"},null,null]},{"text":"Frag stattdessen Tom.","en":"Ask Tom instead.","words":[{"g":"to ask","l":"fragen"},null,null]},{"text":"Tom entschied sich stattdessen dafür.","en":"Tom decided to do that instead.","words":[null,{"g":"to decide","l":"entscheiden"},{"g":"oneself"},null,{"g":"for that, for it"}]}]}